/-!
# Stage Ten canonical runtime

Finite causal depth indexes the exact physical temporal visit generated by
the existing `livingRootNextVisit`; no finite five-position enum, terminal
marker, or sibling physics compiler is introduced.  The public face inventory
is the complete projection carrier already installed in the same
authoritative root.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

